590
00:42:59,079 --> 00:43:00,079
is running out of ammunition,

591
00:43:00,079 --> 00:43:01,039
with over 10,000 casualties.

592
00:43:01,199 --> 00:43:02,199
They urgently need support.

593
00:43:02,840 --> 00:43:03,659
If we can

594
00:43:03,659 --> 00:43:05,000
go north to support them,

595
00:43:05,000 --> 00:43:06,199
relying on the Great Wall,

596
00:43:06,639 --> 00:43:07,099
we might

597
00:43:07,099 --> 00:43:08,599
be able to keep the Japanese out.

598
00:43:16,119 --> 00:43:17,239
This is Wubei Pass.

599
00:43:18,840 --> 00:43:20,699
No matter how fierce the battle is,

600
00:43:21,699 --> 00:43:23,219
that's the Central Army's business.

601
00:43:24,139 --> 00:43:25,300
We can't

602
00:43:27,300 --> 00:43:29,159
just throw our men into the abyss.

603
00:43:30,179 --> 00:43:31,960
To keep our army alive

604
00:43:32,699 --> 00:43:34,840
and protect the people of the south,

605
00:43:35,679 --> 00:43:36,599
I order you

606
00:43:38,559 --> 00:43:40,039
to contract our defense line.

607
00:43:40,360 --> 00:43:41,420
We'll only defend.

608
00:43:42,179 --> 00:43:44,039
Meanwhile, make a plan to retreat.

609
00:43:44,619 --> 00:43:46,400
If the situation gets out of control,

610
00:43:46,900 --> 00:43:48,880
we'll move south of the Yangtze River

611
00:43:49,619 --> 00:43:50,820
to preserve our strength

612
00:43:51,360 --> 00:43:52,260
for the future.

613
00:43:52,840 --> 00:43:53,639
Yes, sir.

614
00:44:08,059 --> 00:44:09,659
Anything else?

615
00:44:10,420 --> 00:44:12,039
We can't just defend.

616
00:44:13,699 --> 00:44:14,880
Why not?

617
00:44:18,960 --> 00:44:20,639
The Nanjing government is passively resisting the Japanese,

618
00:44:20,960 --> 00:44:22,000
trying to use them

619
00:44:22,679 --> 00:44:23,820
to weaken the regional warlords

620
00:44:23,980 --> 00:44:25,139
and the Communist Party,

621
00:44:25,139 --> 00:44:25,980
using the Japanese.

622
00:44:27,199 --> 00:44:28,360
But we are soldiers.

623
00:44:28,820 --> 00:44:30,340
If we lose Wubei Pass,

624
00:44:30,739 --> 00:44:31,840
all of North China will be lost.

625
00:44:32,440 --> 00:44:33,840
Retreating at this time

626
00:44:34,579 --> 00:44:36,099
is pushing the people behind us

627
00:44:36,699 --> 00:44:38,099
straight into the Japanese guns.

628
00:44:39,039 --> 00:44:40,340
Do you think I don't know

629
00:44:40,340 --> 00:44:41,900
what Nanjing wants to do?

630
00:44:42,280 --> 00:44:43,619
That's why

631
00:44:44,400 --> 00:44:47,719
I want to protect the Yu's Army.

632
00:44:48,239 --> 00:44:49,420
In this turbulent world,

633
00:44:49,860 --> 00:44:51,659
guns are the most important.

634
00:44:52,019 --> 00:44:53,420
If we go to reinforce,

635
00:44:53,539 --> 00:44:54,440
we will

636
00:44:54,440 --> 00:44:56,400
lose all our

637
00:44:56,800 --> 00:44:57,780
soldiers.

638
00:44:58,400 --> 00:45:00,139
Then I'll be an empty commander.

639
00:45:00,679 --> 00:45:02,340
A commander without soldiers

640
00:45:02,679 --> 00:45:04,239
is nothing.

641
00:45:05,539 --> 00:45:07,039
Not to mention protecting the people,

642
00:45:07,679 --> 00:45:08,639
we can't even

643
00:45:08,639 --> 00:45:10,059
can't even protect

644
00:45:10,679 --> 00:45:11,960
our own family!

645
00:45:12,059 --> 00:45:13,639
If the country falls,

646
00:45:14,480 --> 00:45:15,360
what's the use of having

647
00:45:15,360 --> 00:45:16,420
tens of thousands of guns?

648
00:45:16,880 --> 00:45:18,440
Even if you have troops,

649
00:45:18,900 --> 00:45:19,860
they are just puppet troops

650
00:45:19,860 --> 00:45:21,219
working for the Japanese.

651
00:45:22,719 --> 00:45:24,380
Do you really want

652
00:45:24,920 --> 00:45:26,420
to be a puppet

653
00:45:26,420 --> 00:45:27,760
controlled by the Japanese,

654
00:45:28,219 --> 00:45:29,099
ruling these people?

655
00:45:29,099 --> 00:45:30,980
Do you really trust our military and people?

656
00:45:31,179 --> 00:45:32,079
At that time,

657
00:45:32,980 --> 00:45:34,480
we'll all be slaves of a conquered nation!

658
00:45:34,960 --> 00:45:35,900
How dare you!

659
00:45:50,980 --> 00:45:52,000
If we fight them head-on,

660
00:45:52,579 --> 00:45:54,719
we'll be dead.

661
00:46:06,199 --> 00:46:06,739
If the road ahead

662
00:46:06,739 --> 00:46:08,340
is a dead end,

663
00:46:09,840 --> 00:46:10,739
I'd rather die

664
00:46:10,739 --> 00:46:12,239
in the charge

665
00:46:13,840 --> 00:46:15,940
than in retreat.

666
00:46:16,639 --> 00:46:17,679
What do you want to do?

667
00:46:18,280 --> 00:46:19,679
Since you insist on defending

668
00:46:20,559 --> 00:46:21,199
and don't want to

669
00:46:21,199 --> 00:46:22,500
use your troops to support,

670
00:46:24,219 --> 00:46:24,880
then I'll take

671
00:46:24,880 --> 00:46:25,940
the 9th Army and the 7th Army,

672
00:46:25,940 --> 00:46:27,219
which I trained,

673
00:46:27,800 --> 00:46:29,440
I'll take them to the north

674
00:46:30,179 --> 00:46:31,300
to reinforce Wubei Fortress.

675
00:46:31,400 --> 00:46:32,139
Changxuan,

676
00:46:33,920 --> 00:46:36,059
you're going to die.

677
00:46:38,659 --> 00:46:39,599
Commander,

678
00:46:42,079 --> 00:46:42,900
take care.
